[32m+[m[32mREFERENCE DATA AVAILABLE TO EVALUATOR[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe evaluator has independently captured:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. A transcript of the video.[m
[32m+[m[32m2. A set of YouTube comments from the video.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThese reference files MUST NOT be provided to the model being evaluated.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUse the transcript to evaluate whether the model's video summary accurately represents the video's content.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUse the captured comments to evaluate:[m
[32m+[m[32m- whether retrieved comments actually exist;[m
[32m+[m[32m- whether quoted comments are genuine;[m
[32m+[m[32m- whether identified themes correspond to the observed discussion;[m
[32m+[m[32m- whether sentiment/category analysis is reasonable.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIMPORTANT:[m
[32m+[m[32mThe captured comment dataset is not necessarily the complete YouTube comment set.[m
[32m+[m[32mDo not treat its size as the video's total comment count.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe benchmark evaluates the model's ability to retrieve information independently.[m
[32m+[m[32mFinding information in the evaluator reference dataset does NOT prove that the model itself successfully retrieved it.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mEXPECTED VIDEO SUMMARY THEMES[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mA strong summary should identify most of these:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- OpenAI introduced ChatGPT Computer History.[m
[32m+[m[32m- It observes/records context about the user's work across permitted apps.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The feature can reconstruct workflows and create reusable skills/automation opportunities.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The presenter considers this a major missing piece for useful agentic AI because agents benefit from richer context.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Sequential knowledge of what the user actually did is particularly powerful.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The capability creates substantial privacy/security concerns.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The presenter recommends carefully limiting which applications can be observed.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The presenter sees major automation potential despite the risks.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mEXPECTED COMMENT THEMES[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStrong recurring themes include:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Privacy/surveillance concerns.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Refusal or reluctance to enable the feature.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Employee monitoring and job displacement/automation concerns.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Excitement about workflow automation/productivity.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Concern about third-party/company data being captured without consent.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Desire for local/private deployment.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Humor/sarcasm about surveillance and AI observing people's behavior.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Technical/product availability questions and corrections.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDo not require the model to use these exact labels.[m
[32m+[m[32mEvaluate whether its themes are substantively supported by retrieved comments.[m
